window.products.push({"id":423086,"name":"KASZOO 2 Pack Fall Maple Garland 5.8ft/Piece Artificial Fall Foliage Garland Autumn Decor for Home Wedding Party","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71enUgPxtoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Include】 2 strand of 5.8 feet artificial maple leaf garlands(General Length: 5.4 feet, Stretched Length : 5.8 feet), total length: 11.6 feet. 【Realistic Fall Leaves Garland】In order to look more realistic, we used 7 sets different colors maple leaf on each fall garland. The color of the maple leaves is gradual and rich in different colors, realistically mimicking the true appearance of the leaves in the fall. And the leaves are evenly grained and close to nature. Each garland has 36 branches, each branch has 2 leaves, 72 maple leaves in total, which make it look denser. 【Quality Material】 The maple leaves are made of quality plastic and silk cloth leaves, the garland stems are made of flexible wire, durable and vivid. 【Versatile】 Maple leaf garland is perfect for Indoor, Outdoor, Autumn, Wedding, Door, Fireplace, Thanksgiving, Festival, and Dinner Party, as a kind of hanging plants, it can also decorate balcony, garden, wedding, table, swing stand, stair banisters, restaurants, office. For party and wedding decoration outside, the artificial vine leaves are waterproof and sunscreen. 【Reusable & Flexible】The maple garland can be reused, it is reusable. They can be folded and bent, you can shape it you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71enUgPxtoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KASZOO","source_asin":"B09C63V1L7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C63V1L7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C63V1L7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":423087,"name":"OTSUMAMI TOKYO Sakura Cherry Brossom Pattern Soup Bowl, Tonjiru Cup for Miso Soup, Noodles, Rice bowl, Donburi Dishwasher Safe, Made in Japan (1, Medi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLBBvV-+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The inside of this soup bowl is vermilion, and the outside is black with a cherry blossom pattern, a traditional Japanese design. The small and medium sizes are ideal for Japanese soup dishes such as miso soup, Tonjiru (Japanese Pork Miso Soup) and Ozoni. The large size can be used as a small bowl for noodles such as udon, soba, ramen, pho or cold noodles. It is also an easy to use bowl that is suitable for serving rice or other rice dishes such as beef bowl or seafood bowl. It is lightweight, unbreakable, and dishwasher-safe, making it a convenient tableware perfect for everyday use. Please note that it is not microwave-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WLBBvV-+S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTSUMAMI TOKYO","source_asin":"B08YF47QYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YF47QYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YF47QYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
