window.products.push({"id":423214,"name":"Cotton Rich Classic Percale Weave Sheet Sets with Pillowcase Sham | Yellow | King | 4 Piece Set | Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet Fits Mattress Upto 16\" | Wr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-d-SwZjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY STYLISH DESIGN as you can choose from a range of neutral colors for easy coordination no matter the season or pops of fun trendy colors. Classics of white, cream, taupe, gray and blue shades cover the basic sheet set colorways for easy mixing and matching with existing bedding and home décor. Or add color for a refresh. Our available sheets size range covers many bedding needs. Pair or gift with Carter Comforter Set by Welspun Basics to complete the look. Each sold separately. SLEEP WELL with a comfortable 60% Cotton, 40% Polyester blend. Our cotton-rich sheets feature a cool and crisp percale weave in a 180 thread-count that creates a tightly woven fabric for durable softness. Easy to pair with comforters, blankets, throws and decorative pillows. Our King Set Includes: 1 flat sheet (108in x 102in), 1 fitted sheet (78in x 80in + 16in) and 2 king pillowcases (20in x 40in). These sets are perfect for hotel rooms, housewarming or wedding gift and master bedrooms. MUST HAVE FEATURES of inviting color and relaxing comfort. Our sheet sets perform with a sustainable fiber blend of soft cotton and polyester in a silky-smooth finish. Durable polyester will keep these sheets from breaking down quickly, saving time and money. Solid colors, clean tailored-edges and an all-around elastic band for a snug fit allow for easy styling. Fitting a mattress up to 16” deep, the deep pockets will keep sheets snug in place all night for mood-boosting sleep. QUALITY MATERIAL AND EASY CARE, standard machine washable, soft and breathable, lightweight cotton blended with polyester for a more durable, longer lasting sheet set. Machine wash cold, normal cycle with like colors. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Warm iron if needed. Do not dry clean. However, did you know by adding polyester, you get the advantage of a wrinkle resistant sheet - a total time saver. Be sure to buy 2 sets for each bed to save time and money. DESIGNED WITH CARE, Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. These products are also made using environmentally sustainable farming practices and water saving technologies. We care about the environment and guarantee our manufacturing is leading the way to a better tomorrow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-d-SwZjjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELSPUN BASICS","source_asin":"B09DTD9KFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DTD9KFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DTD9KFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
