window.products.push({"id":423442,"name":"WBHome Christmas Ornament Storage Box with Removable lid, Stores up-to 64 Standard Holiday Ornaments & Xmas Decorations For Seasons To come - 12 x 12 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+gS1MFmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions: 12\" Height X 12\" Wide X 12\" Length, storage box for ornaments Store up to 64 ornaments with cardboard dividers that help keep decoration ornaments safe from scratches and shattering. Adjustable Organizer: The dividers can be easily assembled to fit your needs. You have the flexibility to store big, small and differently shaped ornaments into each separate cube. The compartments can hold either a medium-sized Christmas ball or two small ones. Larger sized adornments can be accommodated by removing the inserts. Significantly reducing your need for more storage containers Simple Identification: A clear identification card slot is positioned in front so you can label your ornaments and keep them organized. The box collapses flat out when not in use and can be stored anywhere. Durable handles allow you to comfortably carry your container from room to room. Durable Construction: Made of durable, heavy-duty cardboard, non-tear Non-Woven Polypropylene exterior, and zippered closure cover, this storage container ensures that your ornaments will last for years to come. The individual compartments keep your decorations from bumping into each other preventing them from breaking. Unlike ordinary storage bins with lids that do not firmly close, our zippered closure blocks dust, dirt, and light from damaging your ornaments keeping them looking. Easy Carry: storage box for christmas ornaments 2 sturdy stitch-secured side handles allow you to easily take your diy Christmas storage containers between Christmas storage room and living room or to take it to an outdoor area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+gS1MFmML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WBHome","source_asin":"B081R64QLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081R64QLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081R64QLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
