window.products.push({"id":423451,"name":"Elegant Comfort #1 Fleece Blanket on Amazon - Super Silky Soft - Luxury- All Season Super Plush Luxury Fleece Blanket King/Cal King Cube Design Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dl4HDvLfL._AC_SL1420_.jpg","description":"All Seasons Micro Fleece Plush blanket is a great addition to any bedroom. The 100 percent coral fleece blanket provides you with a soft and cozy bedding essential. This king size blanket measures 102-by-90-inches. The blanket has a knit hem. This is a solid blanket. This blanket is machine washable in cold water, tumble dry low and remove promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dl4HDvLfL._AC_SL1420_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Comfort","source_asin":"B015UU9EYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015UU9EYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015UU9EYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":423452,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Circle of Kindness Merriweather 4-Piece Dinnerware Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e-2cZAs+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Inspired by the book of the same name by Jana Kolpen and Mary Tiegreen, Circle of Kindness brings the gently and welcoming spirit of the Irish countryside to your table. Based on the Aesop's quote, \"No act of kindness, however small, is ever wasted\", the book plays out the humanitarian premise that one good deed begets another to create a \"circle of kindness\". Each piece of this collection expresses the magic of the simple, giving way of life. This 4 pc place setting includes one of each: dinner plate, salad plate, soup/cereal bowl and mug. Service for one. Amazon.com The Merriweather pattern is a charmer. As part of the new Circle of Kindness collection from Pfaltzgraff, the colorful dinnerware is inspired by the book of the same name by Jana Kolpen and Mary Tiegreen (fans will know of their other book-inspired Pfaltzgraff pattern, Villa della Luna), about the Irish countryside and the beauty of human kindness. Made of sturdy hand-painted stoneware that is safe for use in the oven, microwave, and dishwasher, Circle of Kindness Merriweather presents different colors, textures, and designs on each piece in the place setting. This four-piece individual place setting is a feast for the heart and eyes. The 11-inch dinner plate, in warm yellow with a green braid rim, features a border fully covered with a textured basket-weave pattern. The 8-1/2-inch salad and dessert plate showcases the Merriweather Cottage in a bucolic setting. A green garland design encircles the border, and also embellishes the white, 16-ounce mug with its green interior. Standing out is the soup and cereal bowl, measuring six inches in diameter and holding 20 ounces of steel-cut Irish oatmeal. White on the inside, the bowl displays a wonderfully textured exterior in green, with the same garland design across a white rim band. All kinds of delightful mix-and-match accessories and serving pieces, along with the Circle of Kindness Dunwalsh pattern, are available to set a truly individualized table. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: 11-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch salad plate; 6-inch soup/cereal bowl; 16-ounce mug. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e-2cZAs+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000NTDNDO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NTDNDO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NTDNDO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
