window.products.push({"id":423532,"name":"Qallicon 11.5'' Flower of Life Wall Decor Sacred Geometry Wall Art, Crystal Grid Chakra Wooden Wall Art Yoga Wall Art Decor Meditation Altar Decor Zen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EqmBdyztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Flower of Life is used as a healing symbol. It represents the connection with all living things in the universe. It is often worn as a necklace to promote the harmony of personal energy and increase physical and mental well-being. DECORATIVE WALL ART - Adding such a nice accent for your home decor with this sacred geometry artworks to give your home a combination of rich ornament and high-spiritual meaning look. Harmonizing meditation wall art for yoga studio, cafes, bars, office, as well as artistic creation. Bring good vibes and positive energy to your living space. WIDE APPLICATION - The sacred geometric plate can be placed on any tabletop or hung on the wall. You can also paint them with rich colors or use them as a powerful crystal grid with chakra stones and healing crystals for ritual magic or spiritual crystal healing purposes, or with Reiki energy work for healing. PREMIUM QUALITY - 11.5” Diameter x 0.197” Thickness. This Flower of Life crystal grid made out of high quality natural wood via precise laser cut, etching with curved lines and fine details, adding to its beauty and uniqueness. WORRY-FREE WARRANTY - Qallicon is dedicated to providing qualified products and amazing service. A full refund or free replacement would be offered If you are not completely satisfied with our chakra wall decor crystal grid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EqmBdyztL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qallicon","source_asin":"B08YNFG4T9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YNFG4T9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YNFG4T9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
