window.products.push({"id":423538,"name":"Rabbit Corkscrew, Amado Rabbit Corkscrew 2017 Fresh Style Rabbit Wine Opener Rabbit Wine Bottle Opener with Foil Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k8KZCtoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amado Rabbit Corkscrew with foil cutter is a unique and first time in the market wine bottle opener tool kit. We redesign the previous classic rabbit corkscrew with a compact design and effective functionality that never sold anywhere before. Basically, we focus on the design without compromising the quality even improve it. As a result, our rabbit corkscrew is a compact and with well-designed foil cutter. Made of high-quality 304 stainless steel and ABS plating. Scratched protection and added extra shine with the gorgeous golden color to give a luxurious look. That means we provide the same or improved quality in a compact, gorgeous design. It quickly removes the foil from your wine bottle and uncorking it. Its extreme efficient cutting mechanism contains 4 stainless steel blades that only require a simple press to remove the foil and cork. After using the machine wipe with soap and water to clean. If you are a big fan of Amado Classic Rabbit Corkscrew wine bottle opener then you must try this one. We introduce it for the first time in the market and for our customer satisfaction, we provide 6-month quality guarantee. The real long-lasting, quick and unique rabbit corkscrew is now available at Amado. Amado New Rabbit Corkscrew Instruction: 1. Remove the bottle seal with the foil cutter. 2. Swing lever to full open position and put the opener on top of the bottle. 3. Grip the bottle neck and slowly bring the lever up and return to closed position. 4. Slowly lift the lever back to the open position and the cork is pulled out. 5. Take the opener away from the bottle and repeat step 3 & step 4 then the cork will be released from worm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k8KZCtoqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amado","source_asin":"B0725K1RS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725K1RS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725K1RS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
