window.products.push({"id":423679,"name":"Lava Enameled Cast Iron Round Skillet with Loop Handles and Glass Lid - 9.5 Inch Diameter, Three Layers of Enamel Coated Oven and Grill Safe Frying Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mreZR25kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURALava: Lava cast iron pots and pans are natural cooking utensils that are most compatible with humans and the environment. The world's highest quality cast iron, enameled in accordance with International Standards, is brought together in Ferrotechnic licensed LAVA technology facilities. Contains no harmful additives. HEALTHFULava: The secret of its delicious and healthy cooking is that it does not allow anything else to mix into the unique flavors that nature offers to mankind. They does not interact with food. The channels in specially design lids collects the steam that produced during the cooking and return it to the food. Thus, nutritional value is preserved. FORCEFULava: It defies years. It is known the most durable cookware. TThe way to transfer the same tastes from generation to generation with health is called LAVA. PRACTICALava: From soups to roasts, from cakes to bread, there is a LAVA with which you can easily and uniquely cook all dishes. Cast iron is suitable for all cooking techniques, whether on the stove, in the oven or directly over the fire. Since the heat is evenly distributed over the entire surface, it provides excellent cooking in dishes such as stews, casseroles, and olive oil dishes that require long cooking on low heat. Meat cooked with cast iron tastes like barbecue. PEACEFULava: Its weight comes from the quality of the cast iron. It is ideal for flavors that are heavy in load but light in health. It can be used on all stove types and can be washed in the dishwasher. Designed for generations of durability, the porcelain enamel requires no seasoning, minimizes sticking, and is dishwasher-safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mreZR25kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lava Cookware","source_asin":"B0C27LGWQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C27LGWQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C27LGWQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
