window.products.push({"id":423746,"name":"3 in 1 Soil Moisture Sensor Meter, Soil pH meter Water Monitor Hydrometer and Sunlight Sensor, Plant Moisture Meter for Gardening Farming Indoor Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eWpLcqAgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"If you want premium plant water meter probe by IGGRO (TM) just like what our customer say on the review, make sure you buy ONLY from TODAY'S DEAL STORE. Other are selling our copied products HOW TO USE THE PH TESTER FOR PLANTS PROPERLY:  MOISTURE Push the switch to the left. Insert probe deeply into soil reaching root level. Keep probe close to the plant. Note moisture level for your plant's watering needs  LIGHT Push switch to the center. Facing the light source, hold the meter next to the plant. Avoid touching sensing element located underneath gauge. Note light level for your plant's light requirements.  SOIL PH Push the switch to the right and insert probe deeply into the soil. A pH reading greater than 7 is alkaline, while the pH reading less than 7 is acidic. Most indoor plants prefer a slightly acidic soil with a pH between 6.5 and 7. Soil that is highly alkaline will cause the leaves to lose their color and stunt the growth of the plant. Acidic soil will cause the leaves to wilt and drop. Why You Must Need To Try Our pH Test Meter Soil - 3 in 1 soil moisture and pH meter (pH Alkalinity/Acidity, Moisture, Sunlight Level) - Super easy to use and read - Sturdy construction to last years - Long dual probe to reach the soil next to the roots - The fastest way to find out if your soil is healthy! - Perfect for winter gardening or summer new planting - Best portable tool for garden, lawn, farming, greenhouse - FREE downloadable \"Secret for Lush Garden\" ebook that will be sent to your email!  So what are you waiting for? Get this soil moisture and light meter now and keep your plants healthy!  Specification: Materials: Aluminum, Copper, ABS Product Dimension: 1.9” x 1.5” x 11.4” Probe length: 7” Weight: 4.2 ounces Color: Green (c) IGGRO (TM)– All Rights Reserved","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eWpLcqAgL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfecto","source_asin":"B01M5FNITZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5FNITZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5FNITZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
