window.products.push({"id":423766,"name":"BABYBJORN Baby Spoons - Orange/Turquoise, 2-Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nl8ZG8rHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The spoon is grip-friendly and adapted to your child’s fine motor skills. Dishwasher-safe Fits Small Hands The BabyBjörn Spoon is designed to help young children eat on their own. The BabyBjörn Spoon has a short handle that is easy for small hands to grip. The spoon is compatible with the shape of the BabyBjörn Plate and designed to make it simple for your child to scoop up food. Since children up until about the age of three readily switch hands, the spoon can be held in either the right or left hand. At A Glance Easy to grip for small hands Easy to grip for small hands Ergonomic design and easy-to-grip materials Ergonomic design and easy-to-grip materials Dishwasher, microwave and freezer safe Dishwasher, microwave and freezer safe Well-Conceived Design The shape of the spoon’s blade allows your child to scoop food up easily. The backmost area of the blade is raised to help nudge food towards baby’s mouth. The groove on the back of the handle ensures that the spoon will not fall into the plate. For Children’s Hands The spoon is grip-friendly and adapted to your child’s fine motor skills. A ring at the very bottom of the handle prevents the child’s hand from sliding too far down along the spoon. The short handle supports your child’s natural hand movements. Quick Facts About BabyBjörn Plastic Completely free from BPA (bisphenol A), PVC (polyvinyl chloride), phthalate esters, cadmium, lead, and bromine Completely free from BPA (bisphenol A), PVC (polyvinyl chloride), phthalate esters, cadmium, lead, and bromine Complies with relevant product safety standards Complies with relevant product safety standards Our kitchen range is certified safe for food Our kitchen range is certified safe for food Playful design and bright colors to inspire children to use the products and learn Playful design and bright colors to inspire children to use the products and learn Recyclable Recyclable Tested and Safe Tested and Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nl8ZG8rHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BabyBjörn","source_asin":"B00FNJ7I26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FNJ7I26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FNJ7I26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
