window.products.push({"id":423829,"name":"Scented Candles Christmas Gifts for Women, 15.8oz Large Jar Candle for Home, Natural Organic Balsam Cedar Scent, Aromatherapy Soy Wax Pine Candle, Rel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619tYXrWqqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"CHRISTMAS CANDLES - The delicate label on the large jar candle illustrates a part of a charming Christmas tree decorated with pine cones, cinnamon and small flickering lights, charming, understated, but full of festive atmosphere, bringing you a refreshing holidy mood. When ignited, the notes of cedar, balsam, musk, fir and juniper berry will fill your room with forest notes, and the glittering candlelights will help you escape from busy life. Remenber, fall and winter are seasons to get cozy! IDEAL GIFTS FOR WOMEN & MEN - Scented candles are popular gifts for both women and men whose minds are asking for stress relief or who enjoy aromatherapy routines after a long day. Our scented candle is packaged in a minimal brown paper box, simple but attractive enough. As thoughtful gifts, these Christmas candles can create relaxing atmosphere for your mom, sisters, grandma, women friends, girlfriend, female coworkers, yourself, boyfriend, brothers and dad. NATURAL SOY CANDLE - Our scented candles are crafted from natural soy wax and scented with organic cedar balsam essences. With a vintage wooden lid, each candle is hand-poured into a clean glass jar and paired with a lead-free cotton wick. This cedar candle measures 3.54(W) x 3.54(L) x 3.93(H) inches and net weighs 15.8oz, providing 240+ hours burn time. MINIMAL ROOM DECOR - Featuring simple and elegant design, our jar candles can be used as aesthetic fall decor or winter decor. Placed in the living room, bedroom, bathroom or kitchen, they help enhance holiday vibes and is beautiful anywhere. CANDLES FOR HOME SCENTED - When lit up, the candle burns evenly and smokelessly, making work, sleep, meditation, yoga, bathing or reading more pleasant and comfortable. Light up our Christmas themed scented candle and have a sensory relaxation at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619tYXrWqqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERSUN","source_asin":"B0BPSRNVYN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSRNVYN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSRNVYN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
