window.products.push({"id":423959,"name":"Presto 06011 Slow Cooker, Red (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qllew6VVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qllew6VVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07RDY5K8X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RDY5K8X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RDY5K8X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":423960,"name":"DENNIS STORE Personalized Fleece Blanket Customized Name Monkey Graphic Funny Quote Furry Cozy Throws Gifts for Mother Father Sister Brother On Birthd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614hZueZBDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"ADORABLE MONKEY PERSONALIZED BLANKET FOR ANIMAL LOVERS If you are looking for a high-quality blanket with personalized design and soft material for your family and friends on Christmas, birthday, engagement, graduation, Father's Day, Mother's Day,..., this blanket will be the best option for you. Your beloved people will be satisfied and happy with this meaningful gift. CUSTOMIZED PRODUCT BY SIMPLE STEPS 1. Select the button \"CUSTOMIZE NOW\"2. Add the name to the blanket. PRODUCT DETAILS Thanks to the high-quality material which is soft, eco-friendly, wrinkle-free, and anti-pilling, this personalized blanket is suitable for four seasons. You can use it to keep your body warm when watching TV, talking to family, reading a book, listening to music,... Our product is available in 3 sizes, so it is great for kids, teenagers, and adults. Additionally, this blanket is easy to clean by hand or washing machine with a light detergent. Tumble dry on low heat, hang dry recommended. Please get in touch with us if you have any problems with our products. We will try our best to meet your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614hZueZBDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DENNIS STORE","source_asin":"B09V6Q8PG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V6Q8PG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V6Q8PG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":423961,"name":"Jaxx Pillow Saxx 3.5 Foot Giant Décor Floor Pillow, Premium Chenille Cover, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":107.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPGPb7vcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our most popular bag, The pillow sax is for those looking for variety in their lounging options. And now, it's even better and softer with the Premium chenille cover. Like having one gigantic pillow, It molds around you to suit your style. In the 3. 5' Size, it works as a room floor pillow when flat with plenty of room to relax and up against the wall It provides the perfect position for reading. Plus, it is easy to store under a bed or table when not in use-not that you will ever want to leave this platform of peacefulness. We stuff our sax with shredded foam micro-cushions and cover it in the finest, most breathable materials. When it gets dirty just throw the cover in the wash and it's good as new. Care instructions for premium chenille cover: Machine wash with cold water and tumble dry on low heat. Fluff as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fPGPb7vcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jaxx","source_asin":"B0BZX898SZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZX898SZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZX898SZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":423962,"name":"IceTopper XL Ice Cube Tray with Attached Lids - Easy Release Ice Cube Molds, 8 Large Cubes per Tray, Stackable, Microwave & Dishwasher Safe, 100% Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"KEEP ICE FRESH & PROTECTED: Ice Topper XL ice cube tray keeps ice fresh and free from odors and crud. Close the watertight lids to prevent accidental water spills on your way to the freezer. Stackable for easy & neat storage. Great for picnics, parties, and cocktails! FOOD GRADE SILICONE: Ice Trays are made of food grade silicone and are 100% BPA free, Phthalate Free, and food safe. Makes 8 LARGE SIZED CUBES - perfect for everything from ice, whiskey, juice, sauce, soup, to baby food. Microwave Safe. EASY RELEASE: Remove the ice you need while keeping the rest fresh. Cube mold is non-stick and won't break in the fridge. Smooth inside so it's easy to pop out and release the ice cubes. Each cube measures 2” each side. STACKABLE STORAGE: Trays fit any home refrigerator, dormitory, or mini fridge, and stack conveniently in the freezer without sticking. Stay neat and save space! DURABLE & DISHWASHER SAFE: Well made with a sturdy design, the tray is dishwasher safe (top rack) and crack resistant. Rinse occasionally with water and vinegar for best results. Comes with a 1 Year Money Back Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyTopper","source_asin":"B0BMKMDY1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-423962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMKMDY1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMKMDY1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
